---Used to specify which [CraftingMachinePrototype::fluid\_boxes](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/CraftingMachinePrototype.html%23fluid_boxes#fluid_boxes) this product should use. It will use this one fluidbox. The index is 1-based and separate for input and output fluidboxes.
