---@field fluidbox_index? uint32
---@
---
---Amount that should be deducted from any productivity induced bonus crafts.
---
---This value can safely be set larger than the maximum expected craft amount, any excess is ignored.
---
---This value is ignored when [allow\_productivity](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RecipePrototype.html%23allow_productivity#allow_productivity) is `false`.
---
