---
---Amount that should not be included in the fluid production statistics, typically with a matching ingredient having the same amount set as [ignored\_by\_stats](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/FluidIngredientPrototype.html%23ignored_by_stats#ignored_by_stats).
---
---If `ignored_by_stats` is larger than the amount crafted (for instance due to probability) it will instead show as consumed.
---
---Products with `ignored_by_stats` defined will not be set as recipe through the circuit network when using the product's fluid-signal.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/FluidProductPrototype.html%23ignored_by_stats#ignored_by_stats)
